# Beyond Infinity, Waughroon Shrine (battlefield.beyond_infinity_waughroon_shrine): enter area 1 (337), trigger
# Burning_Circle: event 32003, its update, finish option 4 leaves. Back at the entrance the trigger shows the menu
# again.
lists WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/Burning_Circle/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/onEventUpdate/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventUpdate/32003 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BeyondInfinity accepted
keyitem SoulGemClasp
login
trigger BC_Entrance
update 32000 option=337
finish
trigger Burning_Circle
update 32003 option=1
finish option=4
warp -338.1,104.3,-260.3 WaughroonShrine
trigger BC_Entrance
